+                        // own landscapes would have flattened. Over ruined, flooded buildings the
+                        // sand hangs in the water and falls the moment its chunk updates
+                        // (thousands of falling blocks around a player), so it collapses here.
+                        if (openBelow && isLooseGround(state)) {
